{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54230","headline":"过尤溪青印石留偈（题拟） · 文炬","name":"过尤溪青印石留偈（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"塔前青印见，家家亲笔砚。\n水流保安前，尤溪出状元。\n（见嘉靖《尤溪县志》卷一。\n称爲黄涅盘作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"文炬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}